# Mods statically composed into mhfu_framework.prx.
#
# One mod per line, path relative to mods/. Lines starting with # are
# disabled. The Makefile turns each entry into mods/<entry>/mod.o.
#
# Default set = parity with the historical live build (Tigrex inject)
# plus the diag smoke-test observer. Uncomment a mod to compose it in.
# Experimental popo hooks are mutually exclusive (they all claim popo
# vtable/transform code) — the mod table enforces this via .conflicts.

diag
tigrex_inject

# --- popo behaviour mods (off by default) ---
# popo_growth
# popo_aggression

# --- experimental hook techniques (off by default; see docs) ---
# experimental/popo_vt8_override
# experimental/popo_vt5_freeze
# experimental/popo_heading_hook
